        "siteId": "site-anduiza",
        "contributorId": "c-joseba",
        "text": "I played in that court myself as a teenager, so this would be 1963, 1964. By then the boarding was long over and the building was something else, but the court was still there and men still came. The floor was wood and it had a dead spot near the left wall that everybody knew about. You learned to play around it.",
